  "summary": "<p><b>Tribal Healthcare Careers Act</b></p> <p>This bill requires the Department of Health and Human Services (HHS) to reserve a portion of Health Profession Opportunity Grants for Indian tribes, tribal organizations, and tribal colleges and universities.</p> <p>HHS must award at least 10 grants to tribal applicants.</p>",
